{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mamedev/mame/issues/12948","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mamedev/mame","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mamedev/mame/issues/12948/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mamedev/mame/issues/12948/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mamedev/mame/issues/12948/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mamedev/mame/pull/12948","id":2639336159,"node_id":"PR_kwDOANo_SM6BHOas","number":12948,"title":"Fix cue, toc, gdi parsers","user":{"login":"987123879113","id":63495610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDk1NjEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63495610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113","html_url":"https://github.com/987123879113","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/987123879113/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-11-06T22:01:35Z","updated_at":"2024-11-10T07:18:17Z","closed_at":"2024-11-08T16:23:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mamedev/mame/pulls/12948","html_url":"https://github.com/mamedev/mame/pull/12948","diff_url":"https://github.com/mamedev/mame/pull/12948.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mamedev/mame/pull/12948.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-08T16:23:07Z"},"body":"For `parse_cue` and `parse_toc`: The last line of the file gets dropped because the code was checking for `feof` directly after doing a `fgets`, so if you have something like an INDEX command as the very last line without a newline at the end of the file then it would get dropped causing an error, or potentially an improper CHD depending on what data was dropped. The diff looks large for those parts but it's just because I changed the indentation level.\r\n\r\nFor `parse_gdi`: I rewrote the GDI parser to have a lot more sanity checks + just be more robust than before. Previously it would just trust that there were X number of tracks as specified in the first line of the file. If you change that to be a number larger than could be stored in `outtoc.tracks` then it would segfault. And if the file was blank it'd just cause chdman to get stuck compressing at nan%. ","closed_by":{"login":"cuavas","id":9678431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2Nzg0MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9678431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas","html_url":"https://github.com/cuavas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuavas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mamedev/mame/issues/